B.SO=s(["Last Saturday, Malika was walking home from the market when she heard a strange sound. It was coming from behind a big tree. She looked carefully and saw a tiny brown puppy. It was cold, hungry and very scared.",'Malika didn\'t know what to do. She called her mum, and her mum said, "Bring it home, but we have to find its owner." At home, Malika gave the puppy some warm milk and a soft blanket. The puppy fell asleep immediately.','The next day, Malika and her brother made posters with a photo of the puppy. They put them up all around the neighbourhood. Three days later, an old man knocked on the door. "That\'s my Bobik!" he shouted happily. The puppy jumped into his arms.',"The man was so grateful that he invited Malika to visit Bobik whenever she wanted. Now they are best friends."],t.s)
