B.Uf=s(["Dear Diary, today was amazing! We set off from Tashkent at seven in the morning on the fast train, Afrosiyob. The journey took only two hours, and I watched the fields and mountains through the window.","First, we went sightseeing at the Registan. I couldn't believe how huge and beautiful the three madrasahs are! Our guide told us that they were built hundreds of years ago and that the blue tiles are made by hand. Lots of tourists from different countries were taking photos.","After that, we had lunch in a local caf\xe9. I tried Samarkand plov for the first time, and it was delicious \u2014 even better than my grandma's (but I won't tell her!). In the afternoon, we visited the Siab Bazaar, and I bought a souvenir for my best friend \u2014 a small blue plate.","I'm tired, but very happy. Tomorrow we're going to explore Shah-i-Zinda. I can't wait!"],t.s)
