B.OP=s(["Bees are small, but they are some of the most important animals on Earth. About one third of the food we eat \u2014 including apples, cherries and almonds \u2014 depends on bees, because they carry pollen from flower to flower.","A honeybee colony can have up to 60,000 bees, and every bee has a job. The queen lays eggs \u2014 up to 2,000 a day! Worker bees, which are all female, collect nectar, make honey, clean the hive and protect it. Male bees, called drones, don't have a sting.",'Bees also have an amazing way of communicating: they dance! When a bee finds good flowers, it returns to the hive and does a "waggle dance". The dance shows the other bees the direction and the distance to the food.',"Unfortunately, the number of bees is falling because of pollution, pesticides and climate change. You can help by planting flowers on your balcony or in your garden."],t.s)
