B.SC=s(["Should students be allowed to use phones at school? This question causes a lot of arguments between students, parents and teachers.","Some people think phones should be banned. They say that phones distract students from lessons. Instead of listening to the teacher, students check messages or play games. Also, during breaks, many students stare at their screens instead of talking and playing with their friends. Some countries, like France, have already banned phones in schools.","Other people think phones can be useful. Students can use them to search for information, use dictionaries or learn with educational apps. In an emergency, parents can contact their children quickly.","In my opinion, the best solution is somewhere in the middle. Phones should stay in bags during lessons, but teachers can allow them for special tasks. That way, we can enjoy the advantages of technology without the disadvantages. What do you think?"],t.s)
