B.PA=s(["Four friends \u2014 Kamila, Dilshod, Aziz and Lola \u2014 started a band in Aziz's garage when they were fourteen. They didn't have expensive instruments. Kamila played an old guitar that belonged to her uncle, and Aziz used kitchen pots as drums!","At first, the neighbours complained about the noise. But the friends didn't stop. They rehearsed every day after school and wrote their own songs. Lola wrote the lyrics, mostly about friendship and growing up.","One day, Dilshod uploaded a video of their song \"Sunny Days\". They didn't expect anything, but the next morning the video had fifty thousand views! People loved the song's happy melody and honest words.",'Soon a local radio station invited them for an interview, and they played their first real concert in front of an audience of five hundred people. "We were so nervous," says Kamila, "but when the audience started singing our song, it was the best feeling in the world." The neighbours don\'t complain anymore \u2014 now they are their biggest fans.'],t.s)
